{
    "title": "SpanningTiles",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfc4Players need to control the character by sliding the screen, maneuvering to stack as many tiles as possible. The higher the stack, the taller the character stands. You'll need a certain number of tiles to ensure you can dash to the finish line and complete your objectives. In this game, you will explore various mazes and experience different environmental changes, adding both fun and challenge to the gameplay. Moreover, players can unlock cool hero skins through achievements and tasks in the game, enhancing visual enjoyment and adding to the game's replay value and personalization. Test your reflexes and strategic skills in SpanningTiles and create your own high-score record!\ud83c\udfc4",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfc4Players need to control the character by sliding the screen, maneuvering to stack as many tiles as possible. The higher the stack, the taller the character stands. You&#39;ll need a certain number of tiles to ensure you can dash to the finish line and complete your objectives. In this game, you will explore various mazes and experience different environmental changes, adding both fun and challenge to the gameplay. Moreover, players can unlock cool hero skins through achievements and tasks in the game, enhancing visual enjoyment and adding to the game&#39;s replay value and personalization. Test your reflexes and strategic skills in SpanningTiles and create your own high-score record!\ud83c\udfc4",
